{title: Kuchh To Log Kahenge}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C],        kuchh to log kahenge,
[C],        logon ka kaam hai kahanaa
[C] [Am],        chhoDo bekar ki baaton mein
[F] [A#],        kahin beet naa jae raina
[C] [F],        kuch reet jagata ki aisi hai
[C] [F] [C],        har ek subaha ki shyam hui
[C] [F],        tU kaun hai tera naam hai kya
[C] [A#],        sita bhi yaha badnam hui
[C] [Am],        phira kyu sansar ki baaton se
[F] [A#],        bhig gaye tere nayana
[C],        kuchha to log kahenge,
[C],        logon kaa kaam hai kahanaa
